# Scripts run in Linux containers keep LF line endings.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
# Database migrations: their checksum is stored in every database, so a
# build from CRLF files (a Windows checkout) would refuse existing databases
# ("migration 1 was previously applied but has been modified").
*.sql text eol=lf
# Pictures embedded in the program: never converted.
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
